  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 Digital transformation Egypt Red Crescent</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By providing an earmarked pledge</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earmarked pledge to IFRC Middle East Emergency appeal to Support Egypt Red Crescent. ERCS, together with IFRC Egypt Office and IFRC Regional Office</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt Red Crescent and ultimately people affected from Gaza and West Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are funding feature development on the QR code tracking system that enables PRCS and other humanitarian organizations to better track the logistics pipeline. 
We are funding wider information management needs such as development of an ERP system, hardware, data protection measures and server storage.</narrative>
  </description>
